# The page's own headers. The policy reports and
# does not block yet: watch a week of play, then rename the header to enforce it.
# Reports go to the server's /api/csp-report (docs/rules/server.md R-SERVER-039): report-to names the Reporting API's
# endpoint, which Reporting-Endpoints defines on this origin, and report-uri is the older form for browsers without it.
# Both are paths on the page's own origin, so the same file serves every deployment.
# wasm-unsafe-eval: the models' mesh decoder. challenges.cloudflare.com: the bot check.
# blob: the models' textures, fetched from blob addresses, and the shared cards.
# font-src data: the sign font, small enough that the build inlines it.
# If the server is ever on another address than the page, connect-src names it, with its wss: form.
# static.cloudflareinsights.com and cloudflareinsights.com: Cloudflare Web Analytics' beacon and its reports,
# in the page only when the build has VITE_ANALYTICS_TOKEN (src/shared/analytics/beacon.ts).
# Caching (docs/rules/server.md R-SERVER-038): every file is asked about again before use (no-cache: kept, but
# revalidated), so a new build reaches the next load; the page itself above all. Only the files under /assets/ whose
# names carry the hash of their contents (the build's code, the models) are kept for a year untouched. The models'
# manifest has a fixed name, so it is asked about every time like the page. A later rule's "! Cache-Control" drops
# the earlier rule's value, so each path carries one.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; connect-src 'self' blob: https://cloudflareinsights.com; img-src 'self' data: blob:; media-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; worker-src 'self' blob:; font-src 'self' data:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; report-uri /api/csp-report; report-to csp
  Reporting-Endpoints: csp="/api/csp-report"
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/index.html
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/manifest.json
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: no-cache
